HydroLink patch for hydroxide (MIT), applied on top of the pinned commit of build/hydroxide.lock.

Origin: upstream pull request https://codeberg.org/emersion/hydroxide/pulls/359 (head b185380d2a02),
with one change: on a human verification challenge (Proton error 9001) the URL is still printed
and one line on stdin continues, also without a terminal, so the HydroLink worker can show the
URL in the panel and continue once the person has solved it. No CAPTCHA is bypassed.

Adds opt-in environment variables to 'hydroxide auth': HYDROXIDE_PASSWORD, HYDROXIDE_MAILBOX_PASSWORD,
HYDROXIDE_BRIDGE_PASSWORD (base64 of 32 bytes), HYDROXIDE_TOTP. Unset: unchanged behaviour.

